      "sections": [
        {
          "number": 3,
          "title": "灵籁之契冥相因",
          "act": "幕间",
          "notes": [],
          "tasks": [
            {
              "sequence": 70,
              "quest_id": 192000007,
              "title": "灵籁之契冥相因",
              "reading_status": "ordered_draft",
              "notes": [],
              "events": [
                {
                  "sequence": 1,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "旁白",
                  "text": "在华胥院工作人员的带领下，秧秧接受了一系列测试。",
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_52"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 2,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "测试结束了，不过结果还需要一段时间才能出来，麻烦你稍等一会儿吧。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_51"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 3,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "姐姐？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 4,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "刚才在城里遇到了漂泊者，她告诉我你在这里，我就来啦。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 5,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "嗯，我在等我的频谱检验结果。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_5"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 6,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "你和漂泊者回来的时候突然变了一个样，可把我吓得不轻……",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_6"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 7,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "哈哈……我也不知道为什么……回过神来的时候，就已经变成这副样子了。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_8"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 8,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "不过，我还是我，姐姐不用太担心啦。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_9"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 9,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "等哪年过年回家，父亲母亲肯定会大吃一惊吧。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_10"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 10,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "……说起来，确实很久没回去了，不知道父亲母亲，还有明庭现在是什么样子。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_11"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 11,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "我前段时间顺道回去看望过了，他们精力可好啦，听说下个月还要去重州旅游呢。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_12"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 12,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "对了……母亲还托我给你带一样东西，本来想去今州交到你手上的，没想到中途出了那么多岔子，差点给忘了。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_13"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 13,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "收下吧，秧秧。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_14"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 14,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "这是……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_16"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 15,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "你忘了吗？我们家里的传统，每当子女成年的时候，父母就会送他们一样乐器。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_17"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 16,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "父亲母亲给我们选的，就是「海螺」啦。该说是有寓意呢，还是说耍了个小聪明呢……",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_18"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 17,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "我之前已经从父亲那里收到过了，这只海螺，是母亲到海边，走了整整一天，特地为你选的。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_19"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 18,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "恭喜你长大成人，秧秧。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_20"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 19,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "我……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_21"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 20,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "总觉得，没什么真实感……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_22"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 21,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "我比起离开家的时候，到底成长了多少呢？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_23"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 22,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "肯定啊，都快成长到爸妈要认不出来的程度了。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_24"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 23,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "不过，很认真地说，秧秧，可能你自己感觉不出来。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_25"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 24,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "但再见到你后，我虽然很——不愿意承认——",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_26"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 25,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "我心爱的妹妹，已经长大到，再也不需要她的姐姐去保护了。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_27"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 26,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "姐姐……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_28"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 27,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "不管怎样，我是姐姐的妹妹。这件事，无论如何也不会改变的。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_29"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 28,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "是吗？嘿嘿，这样姐姐就安心啦。不过，姐姐觉得，还是有一些东西是可以改变的。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_30"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 29,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "比如，那些你在给我的信里的话，要不要对真正想说的那个人说出来呢？",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_31"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 30,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "姐姐——！",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_32"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 31,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "好啦，不逗你了。商会的人就要到四鸣井了，我还得去和他们谈一些物资的接洽。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_33"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 32,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "穗穗",
                  "text": "有空也给老家回个信哦，秧秧。",
                  "speaker_id": 350099,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_34"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 33,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "姐姐真是……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_36"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 34,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "母亲……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_38"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 35,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "听说，海螺会记录浪潮的声音……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_39"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 36,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_41"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 37,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "祀声之人……",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_42"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 38,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "你还是……做出了自己的选择……",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_43"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 39,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "你是……之前在咎庭里出现的……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_46"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 40,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "走吧，我带你到……让一切开始的地方。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_48"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 41,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_10_49"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 42,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "快快快，秧秧，白芷，我们就要到云陵谷啦！",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_11_52"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 43,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "不要走那么急，炽霞，我们是来勘查地况，不是来旅游的。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_11_53"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 44,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "但是秧秧的流息不是预感到这里会有无音区形成嘛？不快点的话，万一这儿有人被困在无音区了怎么办？",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_11_54"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 45,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "此处人迹罕至，想必不用太担心——",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_11_55"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 46,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "……炽霞，白芷，流息里……好像有新的讯息……",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_11_56"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 47,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "前面不远处……似乎有谁……",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_11_57"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 48,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "这里是……云陵谷……？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_60"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 49,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "她是最原始的那个变量，是让世界跳出注定因果的「混沌系统」。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_62"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 50,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "你与■■■的相遇，可以说是必然，也可以说，是重复千百万次都不一定会发生的「奇迹」。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_63"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 51,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "一成不变的结局或许已然崩溃，在此之后，天上的雨滴将落在哪个方向，便是连我也不知道的事情了。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_64"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 52,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "但唯有一点，是我由衷的期许——",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_65"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 53,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "在世界迎来下一个清晨的同时，希望也会随之诞生。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_74"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 54,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "你……究竟是……谁？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_66"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 55,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "……只是一阵风声的残留。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_67"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 56,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "只是……你已听过无数遍的那道声音。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_68"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 57,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "抱歉，现在，「我」还无从告诉你更多。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_69"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 58,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "祀声之人……不，秧秧，再过不久，你的旅途〔巡礼〕就即将开始，今后，还请你依旧——",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_70"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 59,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "且听风吟。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_71"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 60,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "我的……旅途……？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_12_73"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 61,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "……喂，秧秧，那边！好像有人！",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_20_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 62,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "生命体征似乎还算平稳……应该暂无大碍……",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_20_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 63,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "此地不宜久留，我去原定的地方采集数据，秧秧，炽霞，你们留下来照看她吧。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_20_4"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 64,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "等她醒来后，我们就在■■■■汇合。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_20_5"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 65,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "？？？",
                  "text": "嗯，交给我们吧。",
                  "speaker_id": 178,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_20_6"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 66,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "旁白",
                  "text": "你……醒了？",
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_21_1"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 67,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "（刚才……那是……）",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_2"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 68,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "（奇怪……脑海里只有模糊的印象……）",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_3"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 69,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "怎么了，秧秧？",
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_4",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_3_5_后日谈_7_1:2",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 70,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "漂泊者……？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_6"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 71,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "……没什么，只是出了会儿神。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_7"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 72,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "漂泊者，还记得我们的初遇吗？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_8"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 73,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "当然了。",
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_9",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_3_5_后日谈_7_1:5",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 74,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "其实，在你醒来之前……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_11"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 75,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "秧秧，你的检验报告已经出来了，需要现在就过目吗？",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_13"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 76,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "结果怎样？",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_14"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 77,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "……很正常，却也很奇怪。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_15"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 78,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "与以往报告相比，频谱检验图拟合程度极高，拉贝尔曲线亦无明显变化……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_16"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 79,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "这是指……和之前没什么两样吗？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_17"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 80,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "但是，秧秧获得了新的共鸣能力……",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_18"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 81,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "按理来说，这应该是与玄翎雀共鸣的结果才对。",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_19"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 82,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "这就不清楚了，但报告不可能出错。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_20"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 83,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "玄翎雀是很久以前就已经灭绝的回音生物，如今也不可能去比对秧秧和它的频率。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_21"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 84,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "或许还有一种可能，那就是发生在秧秧身上的变化，以华胥研究院现在的检验手段，没办法验明它到底是什么。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_22"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 85,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "连华胥研究院都不知道吗……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_23"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 86,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "华胥研究院的技术各地互通，即便到明庭去，应该也只能得出一样的结果。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_24"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 87,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "据我所知，也就只有新联邦对共鸣者的研究比瑝珑更深入，他们或许会对这种现象有眉目吧。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_25"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 88,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "不过，总的来说，指标一切正常，对日常的生活和战斗应该没什么影响。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_26"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 89,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "洛倾",
                  "text": "拿着这份报告，就能去军策府报到了。祝你顺利，秧秧骑使。",
                  "speaker_id": 350179,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_30_27"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 90,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "……看来这个问题只能暂时搁置了。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_26"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 91,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "不要紧吗？",
                  "speaker_id": 750088,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_27"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 92,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "嗯，毕竟，现在玄方城的事件还没解决。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_28"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 93,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "而且，漂泊者身上，不也有一堆自己也不清楚的谜团吗？",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_29"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 94,
                  "kind": "choice",
                  "speaker": "漂泊者",
                  "text": "还真是……",
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_30",
                  "choice_key": "剧情_3_5_后日谈_8_1:4",
                  "selected_index": 0
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 95,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "这份力量……虽然还不清楚它到底是什么……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_32"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 96,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "但有了它之后，我感觉……自己能保护的人，似乎比以前要更多一点了。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_33"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 97,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "或许……终有一天，我可以……",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_34"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 98,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "不，我不想这个愿望，变成寄托给「终有一天」的幻想，所以，我现在就要说。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_36"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 99,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "漂泊者，我想站在你的身旁，无论开心或悲伤，无论顺境或逆境，我都希望和你一起面对。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_37"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 100,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "如果你是那阵漂泊无定的风，那么，我想做一只随风飘游的鸟儿。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_38"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 101,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "也许现在我的羽翼还不够丰满，也许，我还要走很长一段路，才能追上你的步伐。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_39"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 102,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "但这份誓言不会改变，这份情感，会成为指引我的信标——",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_40"
                },
                {
                  "sequence": 103,
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "秧秧",
                  "text": "——直到，世界的尽头。",
                  "speaker_id": 108,
                  "text_id": "Main_HuangLong_LLZQMXY_31_41"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "source_chapter": "梦州 第四章",
          "source_act_id": 42
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
